<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopian birr weakens against the dollar.</title>
<headline>Ethiopian birr weakens against the dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ethiopian birr weakened against the dollar on Monday, the central National Bank of Ethiopia said.</p>
<p>It posted the birr at a mean rate of 6.5320 against the dollar compared to 6.4970 on Friday. Against the pound, the birr strengthened to a mean rate of 10.4623 from 10.5251 last week.</p>
</text>
